OL,3,ATrump shares misleading video of King
OL,4,Aand fainting worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has shared a
OL,7,Fmisleading video on social media which
OL,8,Fappears to show King Charles shrugging
OL,9,Fand walking away from a man who fainted
OL,10,Fduring a royal visit.
OL,12,FThe footage, which has been edited,
OL,13,Ffeatures in a video shared by Trump on
OL,14,Fhis Truth Social platform which appears
OL,15,Fto show other world leaders being
OL,16,Fdisrespectful. The video goes on to
OL,17,Fshow a montage of clips where Trump is
OL,18,Fseen honouring fallen US troops,
OL,19,Fhugging veterans and shaking hands with
OL,20,Flaw enforcement officers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
