OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump shares misleading video of King
OL,4,Aand fainting worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clip of the King was taken from a
OL,7,Flonger video when, as Prince of Wales,
OL,8,Fhe was visiting an Asda supermarket
OL,9,Fdistribution centre in Bristol during
OL,10,Fthe Covid pandemic in July 2020.
OL,12,FThe full footage, which Trump did not
OL,13,Fuse, showed Charles reaching out to the
OL,14,Fman as he fell before remaining close
OL,15,Fby as he received medical attention.
OL,16,FThe video posted by Trump edits out the
OL,17,FKing staying close to the worker.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
